+# Password hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with argon2id. This was the most recent statement on the subject in the project's recorded history, and it replaces an earlier statement that named bcrypt. No parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism, salt length) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
